sequenceDiagram
    participant UW as UploadWorker
    participant RS as Room session
    participant BK as Backend
    UW->>BK: init (Idempotency-Key K)
    BK-->>UW: uploadId = U
    UW->>RS: persist U, offset=0
    loop chunks
        UW->>BK: PUT chunk Content-Range bytes offset-end
        BK-->>UW: 308 Resume Incomplete, received=offset
        UW->>RS: persist offset
    end
    Note over UW,BK: connection drops mid-upload
    UW->>BK: status(U)
    BK-->>UW: last received = offset2
    UW->>UW: resume from offset2
    UW->>BK: final chunk
    BK-->>UW: 201 Created (resource id)
    UW->>RS: mark complete
